Dear Ms. Gauthier,

On April 14, 2026, I sent a formal response to your cost estimate dated Apr=
il 10, 2026, regarding my public records request submitted April 2, 2026. T=
hat letter demanded a fee waiver, revised cost estimates with specific just=
ification, and immediate production of low-cost items.

Thirteen days have passed. I have received no response.

I am following up to confirm receipt of my April 14 letter and to request a=
 response within seven days of this message.

If I do not receive a fee waiver decision, revised estimates, or production=
 of the low-cost items by that date, I will pursue the legal remedies outli=
ned in my prior letter without further notice.

Sincerely,
Robert Samuel White
